                "text": "It was insightful to welcome the Choose Clean Water Coalition, Chesapeake Conservancy, Chesapeake Legal Alliance, Severn River Association, ShoreRivers, and the Arundel Rivers Federation to #CapitolHill to discuss the health and preservation of the Chesapeake Bay watershed.\n \nThe Bay is a national treasure, and so much of our state\u2019s ecological and economic identity revolves around protecting it.\n \n#ChesapeakeBay #EcoFriendly #ProtectNature #GoGreen #Conservation #Preservation #CleanEnvironment #NatureConservation",
