                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In Trump\u2019s America, inflation is rising, Americans\u2019 health care and retirement security are under siege, and a purge of the federal workforce and dismantling of our government is already underway.\n\nOver the past several weeks, I have stood shoulder to shoulder with unions at rallies protesting these draconian policies of Trump and Musk, and participated in Town Halls to hear directly from you on how this administration is impacting our communities. \n\nI\u2019m fighting for YOU, and will continue to resist, push back, disrupt, and resist again.\n\n#UnionStrong #StandUpFightBack #MobilizeNow",
