                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, on the 105th birthday of the late Henrietta Lacks, we honor her extraordinary legacy and immortal #HeLa cells\u00a0that transformed medical research and continue to save countless lives. I, along with @ChrisVanHollen, are working on passing the Henrietta Lacks Congressional Gold Medal Act to posthumously bestow the highest congressional honor upon Henrietta Lacks. Henrietta\u2019s story and her family\u2019s tireless advocacy motivate us all to pursue justice, equity, and progress in science. #HBD #HenriettaLacks",
